JiitasPage: {
	DisplayName: Jiitas, A Celebrator
	WhereToFind: Standing on the bridge to the left of the Spring Hills
	Lore: A worshipper of a small cult named the Jhastae, a calling upon a higher world and a quest to be liberated and saved from their eventual doom. The call down from the fact that the world’s end is near, and that a huge war that will span millennia will occur before nothing passes and there is nothing. They believe two individuals will bring about this, being Sirestias and Frien.  They wish to not be erased, so they believe as hard as they can hoping for their efforts to be rewarded. Jiitas just happens to be one of them, who came to pass her fate, and wears the mask as her symbol of loyalty to it.
}

